1  | ∀x (Dodec(x) → LeftOf(x,a))
2  | ∀x (Tet(x) → RightOf(x,a))
3  | ∀x ∀y (LeftOf(x,y) → ¬SameCol(x,y))
4  | ∀x ∀y (RightOf(x,y) → ¬SameCol(x,y))
5  | ∀x (Cube(x) ∨ Dodec(x) ∨ Tet(x))
